  "dcterms:title": "LOINC (Logical Observation Identifiers Names and Codes)",
  "dcterms:description": "Parquet build of LOINC, the standard set of identifiers, names, and codes for identifying health measurements, observations, and documents, published by the Regenstrief Institute. Includes the LOINC table core, answer lists, part files, group files, multilingual linguistic variants, and document ontology. Downloaded from loinc.org via an authenticated account and acceptance of the LOINC download license agreement.",
