      "source": "https://loinc.org/license/ (Regenstrief LOINC License, from prior knowledge; page returns HTTP 403 to automated fetch)",
      "quote": "LOINC content is copyright (c) Regenstrief Institute, Inc.; it is made available at no cost under the LOINC License, which requires acceptance of a click-through agreement and preservation of the LOINC copyright/attribution notice, and permits use (including in commercial products) subject to those terms.",
      "confidence": "medium"
    }
  ],
  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by BioBricks licensing-provenance annotation agent (Claude). The download stage (R/download.R) proves LOINC is controlled-access: it requires a free loinc.org account (https://loinc.org/join/) and programmatically POSTs 'tc_accepted=1' to accept the LOINC download license agreement before the zip is served. LOINC content is copyrighted by the Regenstrief Institute and distributed under the proprietary LOINC License (not a CC/open license), which requires a click-through and preservation of the copyright notice. I could not fetch loinc.org/license (HTTP 403 to automated fetch) and WebSearch budget was exhausted, so the specific commercial-use terms are cited at medium confidence from training knowledge. Classed restricted (separate license + controlled access); commercial use conditional (the LOINC License does permit use in commercial products but only under click-through acceptance and attribution/copyright-notice obligations). HUMAN MUST CHECK the current LOINC License text at https://loinc.org/license/ to confirm commercial redistribution terms and any prohibition on distributing LOINC as a standalone dataset.",
